mshv: release mutex on region invalidation failure

jira KERNEL-1029
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-6.12.0-211.7.1.el10_2
commit-author Anirudh Rayabharam (Microsoft) <anirudh@anirudhrb.com>
commit 173d6f64f9558ff022a777a72eb8669b6cdd2649
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-6.12.0-211.7.1.el10_2/173d6f64.failed

In the region invalidation failure path in
mshv_region_interval_invalidate(), the region mutex is not released. Fix
it by releasing the mutex in the failure path.

